        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕊 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent. Subtle. Psychological.<br>A refined battlefield of angels and demons awaits your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GhosTrick</i> is a strategic board game where every piece hides its identity. Players control both angels and demons, engaging in a deep psychological duel. You’ll deduce your opponent’s intentions, bluff, and aim for one of three unique victory conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fusion of hidden roles and strategic board gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role-based abilities lead to mind games and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three layered victory conditions for dynamic play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match becomes a memorable narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No explosions. No chaos. Just a quiet board filled with meaningful moves and tense decisions.<br>Win or lose, every game becomes a story worth telling. Experience the battle of minds in <i>GhosTrick</i>.</p>",
